{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56897","headline":"锺陵民爲李公谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） · 佚名","name":"锺陵民爲李公谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李公不愉，吾何以居。\n李公不室，我何以逸。\n（见《文苑英华》卷八二四苻载《锺陵东湖亭记》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}